<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Kalati</book>
  <para style="h">Kalati</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalati</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kalati</para>
  <para style="mt">Kalati</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kai, Pawl loe (kami khae hoi ih na ai, kami mah patoeh ih doeh na ai, anih duekhaih thung hoi pathawkkung, Jesu Kri hoi Ampa Sithaw mah patoeh ih kami) ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kai hoi nawnto kaom nawkamyanawk boih mah, Kalati prae ih kricaabunawk khaeah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ampa Sithaw, aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri khae hoi ih tahmenhaih hoi monghaih to nangcae khaeah om nasoe, tiah ca kang tarik o,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />aicae Ampa Sithaw koehhaih baktih, vaihi dung thuem ih kahoih ai hae long thung hoiah aicae pahlong thai hanah, Anih loe angmah hoi angmah to angpaek boeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih khaeah tahamhoihaih dungzan hoi dungzan khoek to om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kri tahmenhaih thungah kawkkung khae hoi kalah tamthanglok hoih bangah, karangah nang puen o ving pongah ka dawnrai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To kalah tamthanglok hoih loe, kahoih tamthanglok tangtang na ai ni; nangcae raihaih paek moe, kahoih Kri tamthanglok hoiah angqoisak ving han kakoeh thoemto kaminawk oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toe nangcae khaeah kang thuih o ih tamthanglok hoih laep ah kalah tamthanglok hoih to kaicae mah maw, to tih ai boeh loe van kami maeto mah maw taphong nahaeloe, to tiah taphong kami to tangoenghaih tong nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kang thuih o tangcae baktih toengah, vaihi doeh kang thuih o let, mi kawbaktih mah doeh na talawk o tangcae kahoih tamthanglok laep ah kalah tamthanglok to taphong nahaeloe, to tiah taphong kami to tangoenghaih tong nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai mah vaihi kami koehhaih maw ka sak, to tih ai boeh loe Sithaw koeh haih? To tih ai boeh loe kaminawk palung anghoesak han ih maw ka sak? Kaminawk palung anghoesak han ih ka sak nahaeloe, Kri ih tamna ah ka om mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, kai mah taphong ih kahoih tamthanglok loe kami mah sak rumram ih na ai ni, tiah panoeksak han ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kami khae hoi ka hnu ai, amtuk ih doeh na ai ah, Jesu Kri amtuenghaih rang hoiah ni ka hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Canghni Judah phung ah ka oh nathuem ih kai khosakhaih dan hoi kawbangmaw Sithaw ih kricaabu to ka sak thaih thung ka pacaekthlaek moe, amro hanah ka pacaeng, tito na panoek o boeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kai loe kam panawk ih khosakhaih atawk bangah poek angpaek hmoek kami ah ka oh, kaimacae acaeng thung ih kai hoi huih to kaminawk pongah doeh Judah bokhaih bangah ka cak kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah ang tahmen pongah, a tahmenhaih rang hoiah angmah hanah kam no ih zok thung hoiah ni kai ang kawk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk khaeah anih kawng to taphong moe, kai khaeah a Capa amtuengsak hanah, taksa ah athii kazoi kaminawk khaeah lok ka thui ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka hma ah kaom patoeh ih kaminawk hnuk hanah Jerusalem ah ka caeh ai; Arab prae ah ni ka caeh lat moe, Damaska ah kam laem let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saning thumto pacoengah, Piter hnuk hanah Jerusalem ah ka caeh tahang, anih khaeah ni hatlai pangato ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toe Angraeng ih amnawk Jakob khue ai ah loe, patoeh ih kalah kaminawk maeto doeh ka hnu ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaihi nangcae khaeah kang tarik ih hae loknawk loe lok amlaihaih roe om ai, tiah Sithaw hmaa ah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />To pacoengah Syria hoi Cilicia ah ka caeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kai loe Judea prae thung ih Kri ah kaom kricaabunawk hoi krang angmathaih ka tawn ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kaminawk mah canghni ah aicae pacaekthlaek kami loe, vaihi angmah phraek ih tanghaih kawng to taphong lat boeh, tiah thuih o ih lok khue ni nihcae mah thaih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />To naah kai rang hoiah nihcae mah Sithaw to saphaw o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saning hatlai palito laemh pacoengah, Titu doeh ka hoih moe, Barnaba hoi nawnto Jerusalem ah ka caeh let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kangphong lok hnuksakhaih hoiah ka caeh moe, Gentelnawk khaeah ka thuih ih tamthanglok hoih to nihcae khaeah ka thuih pae, toe ka sak tangcae tok hoi ka sak han koi tok to azom pui ah oh han ai ah, ahmin kamthang kaminawk khaeah ni tamquta hoiah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai hoi nawnto kaom Titu loe, Greek kami ah oh, toe tangzat hin ka aatsak nganga ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah a tawnh o ih loihhaih to khet moe, aicae misong ah ohsak hanah tamquta hoi aicae thungah a kun o sak ih, kahoih ai nawkamyanawk pongah ni to tiah a sak o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />toe loktang tamthanglok hoih nangcae khaeah oh thaih poe hanah, nihcae han ahmuen ka paawh pae o ai, atue maeto thung mataeng doeh ka paek pae o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lokpui ah kaom kaminawk hoi (kai hanah loe kawbaktih kami doeh lahhaih om ai: Sithaw loe kami mikhmai to khen ai:) lokpui ah poek o ih kaminawk loe, kai han amekhaih tidoeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Piter khaeah tangzat hin aahhaih kahoih tamthanglok paek baktih toengah, kai khaeah doeh tangzat hin aat ai kahoih tamthanglok to paek toeng, tito nihcae mah panoek o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(tangzat hin aat kaminawk khaeah patoeh ih kami ah oh hanah, Piter nuiah toksah Anih loe, Gentelnawk khaeah toksah kai khaeah doeh toksak toeng:)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />im tung baktiah kaom Jakob, Kipha hoi Johan cae mah, kai khaeah tahmenhaih paek boeh, tito panoek o naah, nihcae loe tangzat hin aat kaminawk khaeah caeh o moe, Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk khaeah caeh hanah, kai hoi Barnaba to bantang ban ang sinh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae mah loe kamtang kaminawk ka pahnet o han ai khue ni koehhaih a tawnh o; kai mah doeh to tiah sak han ih ka koeh toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Piter Antiok vangpui ah angzoh naah, kasae thuih koi kaom ah khosak pongah, mikhmai kangtong ah lok ka aek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakob mah patoeh ih thoemto kaminawk angzo o ai karoek to, anih loe Gentelnawk hoi nawnto buhcaak: toe nihcae phak o naah loe, tangzat hin aat kaminawk to zit pongah, Gentel kaminawk hoi angkom ai ah kamhoe ah a oh ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To naah kalah Judah kaminawk doeh anih baktiah angsak o toeng; nihcae to tiah angsak o pongah Barnaba doeh nihcae baktiah oh ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nihcae loe tamthanglok hoih baktiah katoengah toksah o ai, tito ka panoek naah, kai mah nihcae boih hmaa ah, Nang loe, Judah kami maeto ah na oh, toe Judah kami baktiah kho na sah ai, Gentelnawk baktiah ni kho na sak; to tiah na oh to mah tih hanah Gentelnawk to Judahnawk baktiah na ohsak nganga loe? tiah Piter khaeah ka thuih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aicae loe tapen tangsuek nathuem hoiah Judah kami ah a oh o, kazae Gentelnawk baktiah a om o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah kami mah toenghaih hnu ai, toe Jesu Kri tanghaih rang hoiah ni hnuk, tiah a panoek o; aicae mah kaalok pazuihaih hoiah na ai, Kri tanghaih rang hoiah toenghaih a hnuk o thai hanah, Kri Jesu to ni a tang o: kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah mi kawbaktih doeh toenghaih hnu thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kri rang hoiah toenghaih a pakrong o naah loe, aicae Judah kaminawk doeh kami zae ah ni a oh o toeng, to tiah om nahaeloe Kri loe zaehaih toksahkung ah maw oh? To tiah om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka phraek tangcae hmuen to ka sak let nahaeloe, kaimah hoi kaimah to zaehaih sah kami ah ni ka ohsak, tito amtueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sithaw ah ka hing thai hanah, kaalok ah ka duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai loe Kri hoi nawnto thinglam pongah takhing boeh: to langlacadoeh ka hing; toe kai na ai, Kri kai thungah hing: vaihi taksa ah ka hinghaih loe, kai palung, kai han a hinghaih paek, Sithaw Capa tanghaih hoiah ni hing boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sithaw tahmenhaih to ka takhoe ving ai: kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah toenghaih hnuk thai nahaeloe, Kri loe azom pui ah ni duek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw amthu Kalati kaminawk, thinglam nuiah takhing o ih Jesu Kri to nangcae khae kamtueng ah ka thuih moe, mik hoiah na hnuk o boeh, toe loktang lok tang han ai ah, mi mah maw ang doi o?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangcae khae hoi hae lok maeto khue ni thaih han ka koeh, kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah maw Muithla na hnuk o, to tih ai boeh loe tanghaih lok thaihaih rang hoiah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hae tih khoek to maw nam thu o? Muithla hoiah toksak amtong o boeh to mah, vaihi taksa koehhaih bangah maw na koep o lat han?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tidoeh avang ai ah maw paroeai patang na khang o, tidoeh avang ai tanglang ah maw oh boeh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangcae khaeah Muithla paekkung, dawnrai hmuennawk sahkung loe, kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah maw to toknawk to a sak, to tih ai boeh loe tanghaih lok thaihaih rang hoiah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To baktih toengah Abraham mah Sithaw to tang pongah, a tanghaih to toenghaih ah tapom pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tanghaih tawn kaminawk loe, Abraham ih caa ah oh o, tito panoek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk loe Sithaw tanghaih rang hoiah toenghaih hnu o tih, tiah Cabu mah hnukcoek boeh, Nang rang hoiah acaeng kaminawk boih tahamhoihaih hnu o tih, tiah tamthanglok hoih to Abraham khaeah thuih pae coek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To pongah tanghaih tawn kaminawk loe, tanghaih tawn Abraham hoi nawnto tahamhoihaih hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaalok toksakhaih thungah kaom kaminawk boih loe, tangoenghaih thungah oh o; sak koi kaom, kaalok thungah tarik ih loknawk boih pazui poe ai kaminawk loe, tangoenghaih hnuk o, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toe mi kawbaktih doeh kaalok rang hoiah Sithaw hmaa ah toenghaih hnu thai ai, tiah amtueng: katoeng kami loe tanghaih hoiah hing tih, tiah lok to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaalok loe tanghaih ih na ai ni: toe kaalok pazui kami loe pazuihaih rang hoiah hing tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thing pongah bang ih kami boih loe tangoenghaih tongh kami ah oh, tiah tarik ih oh: Kri loe aicae hanah tangoenghaih tongh moe, kaalok tangoenghaih thung hoiah aicae to akrang boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kri Jesu rang hoiah Abraham tahamhoihhaih Gentelnawk khaeah phak thai hanah, tanghaih rang hoiah ni lokkamhaih Muithla to a hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, kaminawk khosakhaih dan baktiah lok kang thuih o; kami lokmaihaih mataeng doeh caksak boeh loe, mi mah doeh phrae ai, thap doeh thap vai ai, to tiah ni hae hmuen doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham hoi anih ih atii khaeah ni lokkamhaih loe sak. Cabu mah kami pop thuihaih baktiah, atiinawk, tiah thui ai; toe kami maeto khaeah ni, nang ih atii, tiah thuih; to kami loe Kri ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thuih koehhaih loe hae tiah oh; Kri ah Sithaw mah caksak ih lokmaihaih to, saning cumvai pali, quithumto laemh pacoengah paek ih kaalok mah phrae thai mak ai, lokkamhaih doeh azom pui ah om mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kaalok rang hoiah qawktoephaih om nahaeloe, lokkamhaih hoiah om mak ai boeh: toe lokkamhaih rang hoiah ni Sithaw mah Abraham khaeah qawktoephaih to paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe kaalok loe tih avanghaih maw oh? Sakpazaehaih pop pongah ni lokkamhaih ah kaom kami khae hoi ih atii angzo ai karoek to, paek thap ah oh; to kaalok loe van kaminawk rang hoiah laicaeh maeto ban ah paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />To laicaeh loe kami maeto khue han om ai; toe Sithaw loe maeto ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kaalok mah Sithaw lokkamhaih to aek maw? Aek ai: kaalok mah hinghaih paek thai nahaeloe, toenghaih doeh kaalok rang hoiah angzo tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toe Jesu Kri tanghaih rang hoiah lokkamhaih to tangcaanawk khaeah paek thai hanah, Cabu mah kaminawk boih zaehaih thungah suek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toe aicae mah hnukkhuem ah kamtueng han koi tanghaih to a tawnh o thai hanah, tanghaih angzo ai naah, aicae loe kaalok ukhaih thungah ni a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />To pongah tanghaih rang hoiah toenghaih a hnuk o thai hanah, kaalok loe aicae Kri khaeah caeh haih, patukkung ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toe tanghaih angzoh pacoengah loe, patukkung maeto ih ban thungah a om o ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kri Jesu tanghaih rang hoiah nangcae loe Sithaw ih caa ah ni na oh o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kri ah tuinuem kaminawk boih loe, Kri to laihaw ah nang khuk o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kri ah loe Judah kami, Grik kami, misong, loih kami, nongpa, nongpata tito om ai, Kri Jesu ah maeto ah ni na oh o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kri ih kami ah na oh o nahaeloe, Abraham ih atii ah na oh o moe, lokkamhaih baktih toengah qawktoep kami ah na oh o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Qawktoepkung loe hmuennawk boih tawnkung ah om cadoeh, nawkta ah oh nathung tamna hoi lahhaih om ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />anih loe ampa mah khaeh ih atue pha ai karoek to patukkung hoi ukkung ban thungah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To baktih toengah, aicae doeh nawkta ah a oh o naah, long atawk tlim ah ni misong ah a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toe atue phak naah loe, Sithaw mah a Capa to patoeh, nongpata zok thungah pomh moe, kaalok thungah tapen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />to tiah ni kaalok thungah kaom kaminawk to pahlong ueloe, a nih ih caa ah oh thaihaih to a hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangcae loe caa ah na oh o pongah, Sithaw mah a Capa ih Muithla to nangcae palung thungah patoeh, Anih mah Abba, Pa, tiah kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To pongah nangcae loe tamna na ai boeh ni, capa maeto ah ni na oh o boeh; capa maeto ah na oh o boeh loe, Kri rang hoiah Sithaw ih qawktoep kami ah ni na oh o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sithaw na panoek o ai naah, taksa ah Sithaw tawn ai kaminawk ih tok to na sak pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toe tipongah vaihi Sithaw na panoek o moe, Sithaw mah ang panoek o pacoengah, tha kacak ai, amtanghaih hmuen bangah angqoi moe, misong ah oh let han na koeh o loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani, akhrah, khotue hoi saningnawk to na uum o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangcae nuiah azom pui ah tha ka pathok moeng tih, tiah mawnhaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae baktiah ka oh pongah, kai baktiah na oh o toeng hanah tahmenhaih kang hnik o: ka nuiah na sakpazaehaih roe tidoeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangcae khaeah kahoih tamthanglok ka thuih tangsuek naah, taksa thacak ai hoiah ni kang thuih o, tito na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka taksa ah kaom raihaih pongah kai khet nang patoek o ai moe, nang pakak o ai; Sithaw ih van kami baktih, Kri Jesu baktiah nang talawk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />To baktih nangcae tahamhoih anghoehaih to naa ah maw oh ving boeh? Angcoeng thai nahaeloe, kai paek hanah nangmacae ih mik mataeng doeh taprok dok han koek to na koeh o, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Loktang lok kang thuih o pongah, nangcae ih misa ah maw ka oh boeh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nihcae mah nangcae palung parai baktiah mikhmai na pan o thuih doeh om tih, toe kahoihah na palung o tangtang ai; ue, nihcae mah nangcae palung han koeh ih na ai ah, nangcae mah nihcae palung han ih ni a koeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangcae hoi nawnto ka oh nathuem khue ai, kahoih hmuen bangah loe amlung poe han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Palung ih ka caanawk, Kri nangcae thungah kacakah om ai karoek to, nawkta zah nathuem ih zok kana baktiah ni kana ka pauep let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangcae nuiah palunghaenghaih ka tawnh pongah, vaihi nangcae khaeah kang zoh moe, lok ka thuihaih dan pakhraih han ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kaalok thungah oh koeh kaminawk, na thui oh, kaalok to na thaih o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abraham mah capa hnetto sak, maeto loe misong nongpata thung hoiah oh moe, kalah maeto loe kaloih nongpata thung hoiah oh, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toe misong nongpata ih capa loe taksa koehhaih baktiah sak ih capa ah oh; kaloih nongpata khae hoi kaom capa loe lokkamhaih baktiah sak ih capa ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />To loknawk loe hnuksakhaih lok ah ni oh: to nongpata hnik loe lokmaihaih hnetto thuih koehhaih ih ni; Sinai mae nui hoiah kangzo lokmaihaih maeto loe Hagar ni, anih mah misong ah kaom capa to tapen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hagar loe Arabia prae ah kaom Sinai mae ah oh, vaihi thuem ih Jerusalem hoiah anghmong, anih loe a caa hoi nawnto misong ah oh hoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toe ranui ah kaom Jerusalem loe kaloih nongpata, aicae boih ih amno ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Caa kaak, caa sah vai ai nongpata nang, anghoe ah; nawkta tapenhaih kana panoek vai ai nang, tha hoi hang ah: haek ih nongpata loe sava tawn nongpata pong pop kue ah caa sak, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, aicae loe Isak baktiah lokkamhaih caa ah ni a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toe taksa koehhaih ah tapen kami mah Kacai Muithla koehhaih ah tapen capa to pacaekthlaek, vaihi doeh to tiah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toe Cabu mah kawbangmaw thuih? Misong nongpata to a capa hoi nawnto haek ving ah: misong nongpata ih capa mah kaloih nongpata ih capa hoi nawnto qawktoepkung ah om mak ai, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />To pongah nawkamyanawk, aicae loe misong nongpata ih caa ah a om o ai, kaloih nongpata ih caa ah ni a oh o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kri mah ang loih o sak boeh pongah loihhaih ah kacakah angdoe oh, hmuenzit phaw misong ah om o let hma lai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khenah, kai Pawl mah nangcae khaeah hae tiah lok ka thuih, tangzat hin aahhaih thungah na oh o nahaeloe, Kri loe nangcae han tidoeh atho om mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangzat hin aat kami boih khaeah hae tiah lok ka thuih let, to baktih kami loe kaalok pazui boih hanah laiba tawn kami ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh kaalok hoiah toenghaih hnu kami loe, Kri hoiah angthla moe, tahmenhaih thung hoiah amtim ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe aicae loe tanghaih rang hoiah Muithla ah, oep ih toenghaih to a zing o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu Kri ah loe tangzat hin aat hoi aat ai atho ohhaih tidoeh om ai; toe amlunghaih hoiah sak ih tanghaih ah loe atho oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangcae loe kahoihah na cawnh o e, loktang lok tahngaih han ai ah mi mah maw ang pakaa o?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To baktih zoekhaih loe nangcae kakawk Anih khae hoiah angzo ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Taeh tetta mah takaw to uegh boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Poekhaih kalah na tawn o mak ai, tiah Angraeng ah oephaih ka tawnh: toe mi kawbaktih doeh, nangcae raihaih paek kami loe, a zaehaih baktih toengah lokcaekhaih to tong tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To pacoengah nawkamyanawk, tangzat hin aahhaih to ka thuih vop nahaeloe, tipongah vaihi khoek to pacaekthlaekhaih ka tong vop loe? To tiah ka thuih nahaeloe thinglam kawng pongah lok angaekhaih doeh om mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangcae raihaih paek kaminawk to na tacawt o sak ving hanah koehhaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, na loih o hanah ang kawk boeh; toe to loihhaih to atue karaem taksa koehhaih bangah patoh ai ah, maeto hoi maeto amlunghaih hoiah tok to sah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah baktih toengah, na imtaeng kami to palung ah, tiah thuih ih kaalok maeto na pazui nahaeloe, kaaloknawk boih pazui ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toe maeto hoi maeto nang kaek o moe, na caak o nahaeloe, maeto hoi maeto amrohaih na tongh o moeng tih, acoehaih hoiah khosah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To pongah hae tiah ka thuih, taksa koehhaih na sak o han ai ah, Muithla ah hing oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Taksa koehhaih mah Muithla to koeh ai, Muithla mah taksa to koeh ai: hae hmuen hnik loe maeto hoi maeto buenglueng tamlet ah oh hoi: to pongah na koeh ih hmuennawk to na sah o thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toe Muithla mah lam na patuek o nahaeloe, kaalok thungah na om o ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaihi taksa koehhaih loe hae tiah amtueng; to hmuennawk loe zu sava laep ah nongpa nongpata zaehaih, tamquta hoi zae sakhaih, ciimcai ai ah khosakhaih, zae sak koeh hmoekhaih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />krang bokhaih, kami doihaih, hnukmahaih, lok angaekhaih, am-aehaih, palungphuihaih, angzoehhaih, ampraekhaih, poek lahhaih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />uthaih, kami humhaih, mu paquihaih, poih caakhaih hoi to baktih hmuennawk boih: to baktih khosakhaih dan pazui kaminawk loe Sithaw mah siangpahrang ah uk ih prae to toep o mak ai, tiah canghniah kang thuih o baktih toengah, kang thuih o coek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toe Muithla ih thingthai loe amlunghaih, anghoehaih, monghaih, palungsawkhaih, tahmenhaih, hoihhaih, tanghaih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />poeknaemhaih, angsum thaihaihnawk hae ni: to baktih tuinuen hoi kangaek kaalok to om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kri ih kaminawk loe taksa hoi taksa koehhaih to thinglam pongah takhing o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Muithla ah a hing o nahaeloe, Muithla ah lamcaeh o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tidoeh avang ai ahmin amthanghaih, maeto hoi maeto karai paekhaih, maeto hoi maeto uthaihnawk to koeh o hma si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae loe Muithla kami ah oh pongah, kami maeto zaehaih mah pazawk moeng nahaeloe, to kami to poeknaemhaih hoiah loklam katoeng ah zae o let ah; toe nangmacae hoi nangmacae doeh acoe oh, to tih ai nahaeloe pacuekhaih na tongh o moeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kri patukhaih na koep o sak thai hanah, maeto hoi maeto hmuenzit anglawn oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tidoeh na ai to mah, angmah hoi angmah kasang ah poek kami loe, angmah hoi angmah angling kami ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kami boih mah a sak ih tok to caek nasoe, to tiah nahaeloe minawk khae na ai ah, angmah khaeah ni anghoehaih to om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kami boih mah angmah ih tok to ni sak han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamthanglok patuk ih kami mah patuk kami hanah kahoih hmuennawk boih to paek thoem nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aling thaih ih kami ah om o hmah, Sithaw loe pahnui thuih koiah om ai: kami mah haeh ih baktiah ni, aat toeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taksa koehhaih patii kami loe, taksa amrohaih to aat ueloe, Muithla koehhaih patii kami loe Muithla ah dungzan hinghaih to aat tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kahoih hmuen sakhaih bangah thasae o hma si: tha a zok o ai nahaeloe, atue phak naah athaih a aat o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To pongah atue kahoih a tawnh o naah, kaminawk boih khaeah kahoih hmuen to sah o si, lokpui koekah tanghaih katawn imthung takohnawk khaeah sah o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawkruk ah kalen ca maw nangcae khaeah ban hoi ka tarik, tito na hnuk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taksa ah hoihaih amtueng koeh kaminawk loe, Kri ih thinglam kawng pongah kaom pacaekthlaekhaih to a loih o thai hanah, nangcae tangzat hin aahsak nganga han a koeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangzat hin aat kaminawk mah mataeng doeh kaalok to pazui o thai ai, nangcae ih taksa ah nihcae amoek o thai hanah, nangcae tangzat hin aahsak han a koeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri ih thinglam khue ai ah loe, kawbaktih hmuen pongah doeh amoekhaih ka tawn ai, anih rang hoiah long loe kai hanah thinglam pongah takhing boeh, kai doeh long hanah takhing boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah loe tangzat hin aah cadoeh, aat ai cadoeh atho ohhaih tidoeh om ai, kangtha sakhaih ah ni atho oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hae zaehhoihhaih atawk baktiah pazui kaminawk hoi Israel Sithaw nuiah monghaih hoi Sithaw palungnathaih om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka takpum ah Angraeng Jesu angmathaih ka tawnh pongah, vaihi hoi kamtong mi mah doeh raihaih na paek hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, na palung thungah aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
